 Umutekano wa Code muri Next.js (Backend & Frontend)

• Koresha ORM (Prisma cyangwa Drizzle): Niba utari gukoresha Supabase Client gusa, koresha Prisma cyangwa Drizzle ORM mu kwandika queries za PostgreSQL kugira ngo wirinde ibitero bya SQL Injection.
• Data Access Layer (DAL): Kora folder yihariye (urugero: src/data/) ibamo code zose zivugana na Supabase. Mbere yo gutanga amakuru yose muri iyo folder, banza ugenzure niba umukoresha yinjiye kandi afite uburenganzira.
• Zod Validation: Koresha Zod kuri buri Server Action cyangwa API Route kugira ngo usuzume amakuru umukoresha yohereje mbere yo kuyageza muri PostgreSQL.

5. Kurinda Ibinyabiziga byinshi n'Ibitero (Rate Limiting & Storage)

• Rate Limiting: Koresha Upstash Redis kuri Vercel kugira ngo uhagarike umuntu ugerageza kwinjira (Login) inshuro nyinshi cyangwa wohereza ibisabwa byinshi mu isegonda rimwe.
• Supabase Storage Policies: Niba abakoresha bazajya bashyira amafoto cyangwa amadosiye (Uploads) kuri Supabase Storage, shyiraho Storage Policies zigenzura ubwoko bw'amadosiye yemerewe, ubunini bwayo (urugero: kutarenza 5MB), n'uwemerewe kuyareba.


